    "headline": "PayPal (NASDAQ:PYPL) Beats Q2 CY2026 Sales Expectations",
    "summary": "Digital payments platform PayPal (NASDAQ:PYPL) reported Q2 CY2026 results topping the market’s revenue expectations, with sales up 4.8% year on year to $8.68 billion. Its non-GAAP profit of $1.38 per share was 8% above analysts’ consensus estimates.",
